  (text
    "Board28x10x1mm. Pin centers local(4,6.7),(10,6.7),(16,6.7),(22,6.7).\nLocal(x,y) maps to dock(X=x-42, Y=8.7962, Z=50.2-y) on component face.\nTail drill0.6mm. Stops touch fixed metal target faces; silicone is not the spring-height datum.\nRoute the short D+/D- loom as a pair. Pin fanout and loose-wire USB impedance need physical validation."
    (at 40.64 170.18 0)
